  - benchmark
  - reproducibility
  - clustering
  - Gaussian mixture model
  - mclust
abstract: >-
  Code, configuration and per-run results of a benchmark of 16 spatial domain identification
  methods (13 published methods and three training-free baselines) on 20 tissue sections from
  10x Visium (human DLPFC), STARmap (mouse mPFC) and MERFISH (mouse hypothalamus), including
  experiments on the sensitivity of results to the clustering initialisation.
